From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:17:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 035/371] black pearl: a finished or abandoned fight is torn
 down so the next start builds a fresh one

A Black Pearl instance was never freed: its world uids stayed taken and requestStart
refused every later start, so the fight could be played once per server run. A monitor
tears an instance down once it is over (Completed) or has been empty for 60 s: its uids
are freed, the world creator and ship manager point back at the main world, and the
instance is deleted (Astron deletes everything under it). requestStart joins a fight
still at its start, refuses one with pirates in it, and otherwise tears down the old one
and builds a fresh one once the old one has left the tables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
